    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
    the case of warrants to purchase common stock or preferred stock, the number of shares of common stock or preferred stock purchasable
    upon the exercise of one warrant and the price at which these shares may be purchased upon such exercise;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
